                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#787878'>Linking Bonus Point*&#9;: </run>
                <run bold='true'><![CDATA[<[federated.0nsk4nn0my84fv116zx2k121x1pv].[usr:Calculation_2802927876674924550:qk]> ]]></run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#787878'>Multiplier/Bonus Point (fp-funded)	: </run>
                <run bold='true'><![CDATA[<[federated.0nsk4nn0my84fv116zx2k121x1pv].[sum:additional_points:qk]>]]></run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#787878' fontsize='8'>*For extra 1000pts on new linkages in Oct&apos;24 to Mar&apos;25, users must clicked on booster on yuu app to get 1000pts yet there&apos;s no way to identify which users clicked, thus we put based on the number that yuu billed us</run>
